                                "sense_id": "5eba440e-77c8-339c-8fd0-dadb2e55ad02",
                                "text": "He had a fresh complexion, eyes of that common uncertain shade of gray, and was closely shaven except for the incipient muttonchops on his ruddy cheeks."
